{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Try to think about $g$ as a transformation of the parent function $y=|x|$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"These are the transformations performed on $y=|x|$ to get $g(x)=\\purpleD{-8}|x-\\greenD{0}|+\\blueD{1}$:\n\n1. Stretch by a factor of $\\purpleD{-8}$.\n2. Shift $\\blueD{1}$ unit vertically (i.e. $1$ unit up).\n\nThis tells us that the vertex of the graph is at $(\\greenD{0},\\blueD{1})$.\n\nIt also tells us that if we move $1$ unit to the right from the vertex, we should go $\\purpleD{8}$ units down.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, this is the graph of $g$:\n\n[[☃ grapher 5]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"grapher 5":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"availableTypes":["absolute_value"],"correct":{"coords":[[0,1],[1,-7]],"type":"absolute_value"},"graph":{"backgroundImage":{"url":null},"editableSettings":["graph","snap","image"],"gridStep":[1,1],"labels":["x","y"],"markings":"graph","range":[[-8,8],[-8,8]],"rulerLabel":"","rulerTicks":10,"showProtractor":false,"showRuler":false,"showTooltips":false,"snapStep":[1,1],"step":[1,1],"valid":true}},"static":true,"type":"grapher","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Graph $g(x)=-8|x |+1$.**\n\n[[☃ grapher 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"grapher 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"availableTypes":["absolute_value"],"correct":{"coords":[[0,1],[1,-7]],"type":"absolute_value"},"graph":{"backgroundImage":{"url":null},"editableSettings":["graph","snap","image"],"gridStep":[1,1],"labels":["x","y"],"markings":"graph","range":[[-8,8],[-8,8]],"rulerLabel":"","rulerTicks":10,"showProtractor":false,"showRuler":false,"showTooltips":false,"snapStep":[1,1],"step":[1,1],"valid":true}},"static":false,"type":"grapher","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}}
